---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Brandon Davenport";
const description =
	"Tech evangelist who ships. AI and data tooling at Hgraph, elected member of the Hiero Technical Steering Committee, and creator of the Hashgraph Enthusiasts Show.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
	<section class="bd-home">
		<p>
			I'm a tech evangelist who ships. For over ten years I've worked both
			sides: architecting systems with engineers, then getting on stage, on
			camera, and on the timeline to make people want in. At <a
				href="https://hgraph.com"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">Hgraph</a
			>, I led the AI and data tooling, including a
			<a
				href="https://docs.hgraph.com/mcp-server/setup-chatgpt"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>Model Context Protocol server and an AI data agent</a
			> that surface Hedera Stats' ecosystem metrics through natural-language query,
			and most recently wrote
			<a
				href="https://hgraph.com/blog/hgraph-in-2026-the-full-stack-onchain-data-platform"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">the company's 2026 platform recap</a
			>. I'm an elected member of the
			<a href="https://hiero.org/tsc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>Hiero Technical Steering Committee</a
			> under the Linux Foundation.
		</p>
		<p>
			On stage, I've moderated panels like
			<a
				href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FTXUdQ6dTf8"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">HederaCon 2025's wallet refresh talk</a
			>, and for three years I created and hosted the
			<a
				href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CpjLibi4jp4"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">Hashgraph Enthusiasts Show</a
			>, 146 episodes of interviews with founders and engineers across the
			ecosystem. I'm the one in the room with leaders: making introductions,
			running working groups, closing deals. Say hello on
			<a
				href="https://linkedin.com/in/itsbrandond"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
			>,
			<a
				href="https://x.com/itsbrandond"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a
			>, or
			<a
				href="https://github.com/itsbrandondev"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a
			>, drop me a line, or grab time on my calendar.
		</p>
		<div class="bd-cta">
			<a href="mailto:hey@itsbrandond.com">Email me</a>
			<a href="/meet">Schedule time</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.bd-home {
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-size: 1.125rem;
	}
	.bd-home p {
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
	}
	.bd-home a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 2px;
	}
	.bd-home .bd-cta {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	.bd-home .bd-cta a {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid currentColor;
		border-radius: 999px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
</style>
